    "text": "This is a greedy heuristic: it maximises covered cells per unit of cost and rebuilds the backbone to free budget for more routers. I have not compiled it or run it on any data set.\n\n**Approach**\n\n1. **Coverage test.** For each row I precompute where the nearest wall is to the left and right of every cell. A router at `[a,b]` then covers one contiguous column range in each row it reaches. Walking outward row by row, that range can only shrink, and the walk stops at the first row where `[x,b]` is a wall. So the range for each row takes O(1) to find.\n\n2. **Initial gains.** Per-row prefix sums of target cells give the number of targets each router position would cover. This costs O(R) per cell.\n\n3. **Distance to the backbone.** For every cell I keep the number of new backbone cells needed to reach it. With 8-neighbour moves this is the Chebyshev distance. Each time new backbone cells are added, a BFS spreads out from them, updating only cells whose distance goes down.\n\n4. **Lazy greedy.** Router positions sit in a priority queue ranked by `gain / (Pr + Pb\u00b7dist)`.\n   - When a position reaches the top, I recompute its real gain and distance.\n   - I accept it only if it is still at least as good as the next entry, it is affordable, and `1000\u00b7gain > cost`.\n   - When a router is accepted, its cable is laid by stepping down the distance values to the existing backbone. Cells are recorded in an order that keeps the output valid.\n\n5. **Backbone rebuild.** After each greedy pass I rebuild the backbone from scratch in a Prim-like way. Starting from the initial cell, I repeatedly connect whichever placed router is currently closest to the tree. The new backbone is kept only if it uses fewer cells.\n\n6. **Spend the savings.** Positions skipped earlier because they were too expensive go back into the queue, and the greedy pass runs again with the freed budget. Passes repeat until nothing improves or a time limit (about 8 s) is reached.\n\nEvery accepted router is checked against the remaining budget first, so the total cost should stay within `B`.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint H,W,R,Pb,Pr; long long B; int br,bc;\nvector<string> g;\nvector<int> nwR,nwL;\nvector<char> covered,isRouter,isBack;\nvector<int> distv;\nvector<int> backList, routers;\nconst int INF=INT_MAX/2;\nstatic const int DR[8]={-1,-1,-1,0,0,1,1,1};\nstatic const int DC[8]={-1,0,1,-1,1,-1,0,1};\nchrono::steady_clock::time_point T0;\ndouble elapsed(){return chrono::duration<double>(chrono::steady_clock::now()-T0).count();}\n\ninline bool isT(int r,int c){return g[r][c]=='.';}\n\nint gainCount(int a,int b,bool mark){\n    int cnt=0;\n    int lo=b-R,hi=b+R;\n    for(int x=a;x<=a+R&&x<H;x++){\n        if(g[x][b]=='#')break;\n        int id=x*W+b;\n        hi=min(hi,nwR[id]-1); lo=max(lo,nwL[id]+1);\n        for(int y=lo;y<=hi;y++){int k=x*W+y; if(g[x][y]=='.'&&!covered[k]){cnt++; if(mark)covered[k]=1;}}\n    }\n    lo=b-R;hi=b+R;\n    {int id=a*W+b; hi=min(hi,nwR[id]-1); lo=max(lo,nwL[id]+1);}\n    for(int x=a-1;x>=a-R&&x>=0;x--){\n        if(g[x][b]=='#')break;\n        int id=x*W+b;\n        hi=min(hi,nwR[id]-1); lo=max(lo,nwL[id]+1);\n        for(int y=lo;y<=hi;y++){int k=x*W+y; if(g[x][y]=='.'&&!covered[k]){cnt++; if(mark)covered[k]=1;}}\n    }\n    return cnt;\n}\n\nvoid propagate(deque<int>&q){\n    while(!q.empty()){\n        int u=q.front();q.pop_front();\n        int r=u/W,c=u%W,du=distv[u]+1;\n        for(int k=0;k<8;k++){\n            int nr=r+DR[k],nc=c+DC[k];\n            if(nr<0||nr>=H||nc<0||nc>=W)continue;\n            int v=nr*W+nc;\n            if(du<distv[v]){distv[v]=du;q.push_back(v);}\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// connect cell id to backbone along gradient; returns number of new cells\nint connect(int id){\n    vector<int> path; int cur=id;\n    while(distv[cur]>0){\n        path.push_back(cur);\n        int r=cur/W,c=cur%W,d=distv[cur];\n        int nxt=-1;\n        for(int k=0;k<8;k++){\n            int nr=r+DR[k],nc=c+DC[k];\n            if(nr<0||nr>=H||nc<0||nc>=W)continue;\n            int v=nr*W+nc; if(distv[v]==d-1){nxt=v;break;}\n        }\n        cur=nxt;\n    }\n    deque<int> q;\n    for(int i=(int)path.size()-1;i>=0;i--){\n        int v=path[i]; isBack[v]=1; backList.push_back(v); distv[v]=0; q.push_back(v);\n    }\n    propagate(q);\n    return path.size();\n}\n\nvoid fullBFS(){\n    fill(distv.begin(),distv.end(),INF);\n    deque<int> q;\n    int s=br*W+bc; distv[s]=0; q.push_back(s);\n    for(int v:backList){distv[v]=0;q.push_back(v);}\n    propagate(q);\n}\n\nlong long spent=0;\ntypedef pair<double,int> PDI;\npriority_queue<PDI> pq;\nvector<PDI> deferred;\n\nint greedy(){\n    int added=0;\n    while(!pq.empty()){\n        if(spent+Pr>B){ // nothing affordable\n            while(!pq.empty()){deferred.push_back(pq.top());pq.pop();}\n            break;\n        }\n        PDI t=pq.top();pq.pop();\n        int id=t.second;\n        if(isRouter[id])continue;\n        long long cost=Pr+(long long)Pb*distv[id];\n        if(spent+cost>B){deferred.push_back(t);continue;}\n        int gn=gainCount(id/W,id%W,false);\n        if(gn==0)continue;\n        double key=(double)gn/cost;\n        if(1000LL*gn<=cost){deferred.push_back(PDI(key,id));continue;}\n        if(!pq.empty()&&key<pq.top().first-1e-12){pq.push(PDI(key,id));continue;}\n        int nc=connect(id);\n        spent+=Pr+(long long)Pb*nc;\n        isRouter[id]=1; routers.push_back(id);\n        gainCount(id/W,id%W,true);\n        added++;\n    }\n    return added;\n}\n\nbool rebuild(){\n    vector<int> oldBack=backList;\n    vector<char> oldIsBack=isBack;\n    backList.clear();\n    fill(isBack.begin(),isBack.end(),0);\n    isBack[br*W+bc]=1;\n    fullBFS();\n    vector<int> rem=routers;\n    while(!rem.empty()){\n        int bi=0;\n        for(int i=1;i<(int)rem.size();i++) if(distv[rem[i]]<distv[rem[bi]])bi=i;\n        int id=rem[bi]; rem[bi]=rem.back(); rem.pop_back();\n        connect(id);\n        if(elapsed()>9.0)break;\n    }\n    if(!rem.empty()||backList.size()>=oldBack.size()){\n        backList=oldBack; isBack=oldIsBack; fullBFS(); return false;\n    }\n    spent=(long long)routers.size()*Pr+(long long)backList.size()*Pb;\n    return true;\n}\n\nint main(){\n    T0=chrono::steady_clock::now();\n    scanf(\"%d %d %d\",&H,&W,&R);\n    scanf(\"%d %d %lld\",&Pb,&Pr,&B);\n    scanf(\"%d %d\",&br,&bc);\n    g.resize(H);\n    {\n        static char buf[2000];\n        for(int i=0;i<H;i++){scanf(\"%s\",buf);g[i]=buf;if((int)g[i].size()<W)g[i].resize(W,'-');}\n    }\n    int N=H*W;\n    nwR.assign(N,W);nwL.assign(N,-1);\n    for(int r=0;r<H;r++){\n        int last=-1;\n        for(int c=0;c<W;c++){if(g[r][c]=='#')last=c;nwL[r*W+c]=last;}\n        last=W;\n        for(int c=W-1;c>=0;c--){if(g[r][c]=='#')last=c;nwR[r*W+c]=last;}\n    }\n    covered.assign(N,0);isRouter.assign(N,0);isBack.assign(N,0);distv.assign(N,INF);\n    isBack[br*W+bc]=1;\n    fullBFS();\n    // prefix sums for initial gain\n    vector<int> pre((size_t)H*(W+1),0);\n    for(int r=0;r<H;r++)for(int c=0;c<W;c++)pre[(size_t)r*(W+1)+c+1]=pre[(size_t)r*(W+1)+c]+(g[r][c]=='.');\n    {\n        vector<PDI> init;\n        for(int a=0;a<H;a++)for(int b=0;b<W;b++){\n            if(g[a][b]=='#')continue;\n            int cnt=0;\n            int lo=b-R,hi=b+R;\n            for(int x=a;x<=a+R&&x<H;x++){\n                if(g[x][b]=='#')break;\n                int id=x*W+b; hi=min(hi,nwR[id]-1); lo=max(lo,nwL[id]+1);\n                cnt+=pre[(size_t)x*(W+1)+hi+1]-pre[(size_t)x*(W+1)+lo];\n            }\n            lo=b-R;hi=b+R;\n            {int id=a*W+b; hi=min(hi,nwR[id]-1); lo=max(lo,nwL[id]+1);}\n            for(int x=a-1;x>=a-R&&x>=0;x--){\n                if(g[x][b]=='#')break;\n                int id=x*W+b; hi=min(hi,nwR[id]-1); lo=max(lo,nwL[id]+1);\n                cnt+=pre[(size_t)x*(W+1)+hi+1]-pre[(size_t)x*(W+1)+lo];\n            }\n            if(cnt>0){\n                double cost=Pr+(double)Pb*distv[a*W+b];\n                init.push_back(PDI(cnt/cost,a*W+b));\n            }\n        }\n        pq=priority_queue<PDI>(less<PDI>(),move(init));\n    }\n    pre.clear();pre.shrink_to_fit();\n    greedy();\n    for(int it=0;it<6;it++){\n        if(elapsed()>7.5)break;\n        bool ok=rebuild();\n        if(!ok)break;\n        if(elapsed()>8.0)break;\n        pq=priority_queue<PDI>(less<PDI>(),move(deferred));\n        deferred.clear();\n        int a=greedy();\n        if(a==0)break;\n    }\n    // safety check budget\n    long long total=(long long)backList.size()*Pb+(long long)routers.size()*Pr;\n    if(total>B){ // should not happen; output empty\n        printf(\"0\\n0\\n\");return 0;\n    }\n    string out;\n    out.reserve((backList.size()+routers.size())*12+32);\n    out+=to_string(backList.size());out+='\\n';\n    for(int v:backList){out+=to_string(v/W);out+=' ';out+=to_string(v%W);out+='\\n';}\n    out+=to_string(routers.size());out+='\\n';\n    for(int v:routers){out+=to_string(v/W);out+=' ';out+=to_string(v%W);out+='\\n';}\n    fwrite(out.data(),1,out.size(),stdout);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
